      <ownedRepresentationDescriptors xmi:type="viewpoint:DRepresentationDescriptor" uid="_5XIUoIcjEfGRuNc7aPXuZg" documentation="&lt;p>This already suggests several system requirements:&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;ul>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;8418&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1fwxjmw&quot; data-start=&quot;8363&quot;>ADSOP shall distinguish current data from stale data.&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;8497&quot; data-section-id=&quot;154lmmj&quot; data-start=&quot;8419&quot;>ADSOP shall preserve the spacecraft timestamp and Earth-reception timestamp.&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;8577&quot; data-section-id=&quot;ihpmgt&quot; data-start=&quot;8498&quot;>ADSOP shall distinguish onboard-detected faults from ground-generated alerts.&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;8648&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1me8e7w&quot; data-start=&quot;8578&quot;>ADSOP shall show the spacecraft mode and autonomous recovery status.&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;8737&quot; data-section-id=&quot;u3h7ri&quot; data-start=&quot;8649&quot;>ADSOP shall preserve the sequence of telemetry, faults, commands and operator actions.&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;8823&quot; data-section-id=&quot;kwc2g8&quot; data-start=&quot;8738&quot;>ADSOP shall support alert acknowledgement without erasing the underlying condition.&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;8901&quot; data-section-id=&quot;bn5dy2&quot; data-start=&quot;8824&quot;>ADSOP shall allow authorized users to access historical health information.&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;8979&quot; data-section-id=&quot;lvh34b&quot; data-start=&quot;8902&quot;>ADSOP shall support different levels of detail for operators and engineers.&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;9103&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1xz3q7p&quot; data-start=&quot;8980&quot;>ADSOP shall continue presenting the last known state during communication interruptions while clearly indicating its age.&lt;/li>&#xA;&lt;/ul>&#xA;" name="[SAB] Monitor spacecraft health" repPath="#_5XA_4IcjEfGRuNc7aPXuZg" changeId="1785180280884">
